    "what_en": "Once installed, Claude adds captions to a single-subject video: it rejects bad clips, picks one of 35 styles (default anchor), transcribes and mattes locally, adds a lower-third rail, embeds peak words behind the subject, and outputs final.mp4.",
    "when_en": "Triggers when the user asks to add plain verbatim captions, cinematic embedded captions, VFX captions, or a named style to a single-subject video; clips with multiple speakers, hard cuts, no human, or burned-in captions are refused.",
